Our idea contest has wrapped 🏆
We asked what you'd build with Tokenomist data. Three ideas stood out, and each wins 3 months of Tokenomist Pro:
@soleparole: supply shock scoring for perp tokens
@token_fan: a portfolio watcher for unlocks, burns, and buybacks
@Dekatria__: backtesting unlock impact with our data

Winners: DM us from this post to claim. The tokenomics data you need to take your idea further.

We hosted this contest to hear your voices and understand how you want to use tokenomics data. Thanks for sharing your thoughtful ideas!
Can’t wait for our next activities!

Buyback-to-emission, 2026 year to date.

@GMX_IO led 34 of 34 weeks, closing at its high of 41.17%.

That is 4 tokens bought back for every 10 unlocked, against a flat schedule of about 2,820 a week. Released supply still grew, at 59% of the rate the schedule implied.

@Pumpfun finished second at 20.38%, or 1 in 5. Movement closed the board at 4.33%, or 1 in 23.

Emission is what a protocol released. Buyback is what it repurchased. The ratio is what reached circulation.

